{"4606500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Signalfall", "steam_appid": 4606500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophic crash, you find yourself stranded on a remote and hostile planet.<br><br>Alone, with limited resources, your mission is clear:<br>establish operations, extract valuable materials, and prove the planet is worth colonizing.<br><br>But you are not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. AUTOMATE. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct modular habitats and deploy automated machinery to harvest the planet’s resources.<br><br>Design and expand your own extraction networks:<br><br>Drill → Process → Store → Uplink<br><br>Everything you build depends on power. Manage your energy grid carefully by connecting machines through a flexible cable system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEND RESOURCES TO ORBIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert raw materials into valuable assets and transmit them to orbit using your Storage Uplink.<br><br>Each successful transfer earns you credits, allowing you to unlock new technologies and expand your operations.<br><br>But every transmission comes at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR OPERATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource transfers attract hostile entities.<br><br>Defend your outposts using automated turrets and direct combat while your systems complete the uplink process.<br><br>The more you send, the greater the threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND EXPAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new resource deposits across the planet, each with unique risks and rewards.<br><br>Establish forward outposts, optimize your production lines, and push deeper into dangerous territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD THE SIGNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-establish communication with orbit and transform from a stranded survivor into a planetary operator.<br><br>Expand, automate, defend — and take control of the planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Modular base building with free placement inside habitats <br>• Automated resource extraction and processing systems <br>• Dynamic defense events triggered by orbital transfers <br>• Power network management using cables and energy sources <br>• Exploration-driven progression across multiple resource zones <br>• Tech tree progression unlocked through orbital deliveries</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophic crash, you find yourself stranded on a remote and hostile planet.<br><br>Alone, with limited resources, your mission is clear:<br>establish operations, extract valuable materials, and prove the planet is worth colonizing.<br><br>But you are not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. AUTOMATE. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct modular habitats and deploy automated machinery to harvest the planet’s resources.<br><br>Design and expand your own extraction networks:<br><br>Drill → Process → Store → Uplink<br><br>Everything you build depends on power. Manage your energy grid carefully by connecting machines through a flexible cable system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEND RESOURCES TO ORBIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert raw materials into valuable assets and transmit them to orbit using your Storage Uplink.<br><br>Each successful transfer earns you credits, allowing you to unlock new technologies and expand your operations.<br><br>But every transmission comes at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR OPERATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource transfers attract hostile entities.<br><br>Defend your outposts using automated turrets and direct combat while your systems complete the uplink process.<br><br>The more you send, the greater the threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND EXPAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new resource deposits across the planet, each with unique risks and rewards.<br><br>Establish forward outposts, optimize your production lines, and push deeper into dangerous territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD THE SIGNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-establish communication with orbit and transform from a stranded survivor into a planetary operator.<br><br>Expand, automate, defend — and take control of the planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Modular base building with free placement inside habitats <br>• Automated resource extraction and processing systems <br>• Dynamic defense events triggered by orbital transfers <br>• Power network management using cables and energy sources <br>• Exploration-driven progression across multiple resource zones <br>• Tech tree progression unlocked through orbital deliveries</p>", "short_description": "Crash-land on a hostile planet and build automated extraction outposts to survive. Defend your operations, manage power networks, and send resources to orbit to unlock new technologies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606500/b7693cd9a5ed72c712799f02a5af226679f033ac/header.jpg?t=1780060324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606500/27d1c662c017daa2075daadf7e9811d1e2f85801/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780060324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606500/27d1c662c017daa2075daadf7e9811d1e2f85801/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780060324", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 Ghz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB Dedicated Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements